1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Finding the right collaborator can take more time than the work itself.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:14,000
You search across platforms, ask around, and still wonder who is the right fit.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Brand Media Collab brings brands, creators, influencers, agencies, media professionals,
production teams, event companies, marketing partners, and creative professionals together.

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:32,000
One collaboration network to discover people and opportunities.

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Choose the profile that best describes the work you do.

6
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Build a clear profile around what you offer and the partnerships you want.

7
00:00:49,000 --> 00:01:08,000
A clear profile helps other members understand your work, your interests, and what you bring.

8
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Search and narrow the people and categories that fit your brief.

9
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Open a profile and see whether the work and interests align.

10
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Browse projects and ideas from members.

11
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:57,000
Check the brief, category, dates, and requested collaborators before deciding whether it fits.

12
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:08,000
When an opportunity feels right, use the available action to save it, apply, or connect.

13
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:18,000
A clear note can help explain why the partnership makes sense.

14
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:36,000
For eligible project collaborations, keep the next conversation tied to the opportunity.

15
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Creators, brands, agencies, celebrities, event teams, media, communities,
distributors, and freelancers each bring something different.

16
00:02:50,000 --> 00:03:02,000
Spend less time searching in disconnected places and more time building useful partnerships.
Brand Media Collab. Good work starts with the right collaborators.
Join the network at brandmediacollab.com.
